Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.60,0:01:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈… 他妈的怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the… What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.80,0:01:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.60,0:01:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.60,0:01:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.90,0:01:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.70,0:01:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.20,0:02:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 赛斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Seth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟你玩个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna play a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.00,0:02:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你一定感到很无助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, you're feeling helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.30,0:02:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这种无助… - 救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is the same helplessness… - Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.30,0:02:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你也曾给予他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you've bestowed onto others.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.50,0:02:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在轮到你来尝试一下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now it's onto you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.70,0:02:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人管这叫报应 我管这叫正义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some call this karma. I call it justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.70,0:02:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,到现在 你坐了五年牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you served five years…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.80,0:02:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你所犯的谋杀罪本应判无期徒刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of what should have been a life sentence for murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.00,0:02:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,法律空子让你重获了自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}A technicality gave you freedom…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.30,0:02:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这阻止你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but it inhibited you…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.85,0:02:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,…认识到夺人性命的严重后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}…from understanding the impact of taking a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.50,0:02:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天 我要给你真正的自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, I offer you true freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.70,0:02:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,30秒后\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 30 seconds,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.50,0:02:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,钟摆会开始从你身边划过 然后逐渐逼近你\N{\fnArial\fs30}the pendulum will drop far enough to touch your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.50,0:02:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在60秒内 它将会把你切成两半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Within sixty seconds it will cut you in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.50,0:02:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,要摆脱它\N{\fnArial\fs30}To avoid the pendulum,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.20,0:02:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要毁掉你用来杀人的工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}all you have to do is destroy the things that have killed…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.00,0:02:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的双手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.90,0:02:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把你的手放进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must insert your hands…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.70,0:03:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,按下按钮 开启你前面的装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and push the buttons to start the devices before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.10,0:03:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你的骨头会被粉碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your bones will be crushed to dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.80,0:03:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会牺牲「杀人工具」…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you destroy the things…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.85,0:03:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,…来拯救另一生命吗？赛斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that have taken life in order to save one, Seth?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.10,0:03:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,做抉择吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.70,0:03:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.70,0:03:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an accident!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.50,0:03:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.50,0:03:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！去你妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.00,0:04:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我照你说的做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did what I was supposed to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.70,0:06:09.60,Title,0,0,0,0,,《电锯惊魂5》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.70,0:06:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看你的手 让我看你他妈的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see your hands. Let me see your fucking hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.40,0:06:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我女儿在哪 你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is my daughter? You…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.80,0:06:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.60,0:07:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 斯莱姆探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Agent Strahm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.50,0:07:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你听到这个录音\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're hearing this,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.40,0:07:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那说明你已经找到了你要找的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you've finally found what you've been looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.50,0:08:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但找到我的尸体对你来说足够了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But is the discovery of my body enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.20,0:08:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是说 你对揭开真相的巨大渴望…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or will your insatiable hunger…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.30,0:08:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,…会让你走进更深的无底洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to uncover the truth push you deeper into the abyss?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.60,0:08:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听从我的忠告 不要再深入了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heed my warning. Do not proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.20,0:08:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这房间 既可以是你的圣所\N{\fnArial\fs30}For this room can either be your sanctuary…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.05,0:08:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可以是你的坟墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or it can be your grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.40,0:08:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来决定吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The choice is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.00,0:08:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.30,0:09:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.70,0:09:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.50,0:11:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去 进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.90,0:11:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.10,0:11:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爸爸在哪 - 他会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's my dad? - He's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.10,0:11:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈呢 我妈妈呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my mom? Where's my mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.90,0:11:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 霍夫曼 - 我来 我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hoffman. - I got it. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.70,0:11:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以走路吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay to walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.60,0:11:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底怎么了 伙计 发生了什么事 里格在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell, man? What happened? Where's Rigg?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.30,0:11:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽力了 他没活过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tried to help. He didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.20,0:11:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.80,0:11:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到个生还者\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a live one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.30,0:12:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.00,0:12:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.60,0:12:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔克女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Tuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.50,0:12:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.00,0:12:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 菲尔德曼先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice to meet you, Mr. Feldman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.50,0:12:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.20,0:12:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我代表你的前任丈夫约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I represent your ex- husband, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.60,0:13:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,按照指示 在他去世后 我要联系你\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the event of his death, I was instructed to contact you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.10,0:13:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你也明白我有多惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can understand my surprise…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.55,0:13:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我知道他的身份后\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when I found out who he really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.20,0:13:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰留了些东西给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}John left something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.50,0:13:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你在看着这录影\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're watching this,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.70,0:13:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉尔 我已经不在人世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jill, I'm long gone from this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.90,0:13:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我的最爱 一直都是 永远都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are my heart, you always have been. You always will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.40,0:13:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会去解释我最近的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to try to explain my actions of late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.90,0:13:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者说 我很难原谅自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suffice it to say that I find it difficult to forgive myself…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.50,0:13:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,对在诊所所发生的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for what happened at the clinic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.80,0:13:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我允许了 确切地说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I permitted, indeed,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.90,0:14:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我鼓励了你去帮助那里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}encouraged your decisions regarding the people there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.50,0:14:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我预见到危险 我应该有所行动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw danger and l… I should have acted sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.70,0:14:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我给你留了个盒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm leaving you a box today,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.80,0:14:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在里面的东西很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}and its contents are of grave importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.50,0:14:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我们不是对所有事都持相同意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though you and I don't always see eye to eye on everything…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.10,0:14:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我相信你会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I deeply believe in you and I believe that you will know…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.80,0:14:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样处理里面的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}…what to do with these materials.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.70,0:15:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要感谢你们今天来到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna thank you all for coming here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.60,0:15:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想作为第一个人告诉你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'd like to be the first to say…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.90,0:15:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,竖锯杀人案已经结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that the Jigsaw murders are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.70,0:15:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些牺牲了姓名的探员今天将得到缅怀\N{\fnArial\fs30}The officers who gave their lives are being honored here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.90,0:15:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但今天我要把一份特别的荣誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}But today I'd like to offer a special honor…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.10,0:15:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给一名从一开始…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to the detective who's been…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.85,0:15:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,…就着手这个案件的探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}…on this case right from the beginning…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.70,0:15:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他通过无私的奉献\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who proved through hard work and dedication…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.60,0:15:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保了其他探员没有白白牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that the people who died did not die in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.00,0:15:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我们把荣耀交给刚提拔的中尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today we honor the newly promoted Detective Lieutenant…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.50,0:15:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,马克·霍夫曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Mark Hoffman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.80,0:16:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.50,0:16:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.80,0:16:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们 非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.00,0:16:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, ahem…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.60,0:16:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过这次考验 如果说我们学到了什么的话 就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throughout this ordeal, if we've learned anything it's that…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.80,0:16:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命是神圣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…human life is sacred.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.50,0:16:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们学到 每一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we've learned that every day…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.80,0:16:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都要珍惜生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}…life should be cherished.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.80,0:16:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,正义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Justice…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.70,0:16:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是带来和平社会的基石\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is the backbone to every peaceful society.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.90,0:16:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信 正义已得到伸张\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I believe that true justice has been served.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.80,0:17:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍夫曼探员 医院有人找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detective Hoffman, you're wanted at the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.40,0:17:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是关于彼瑞兹探员的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about Agent Perez.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.10,0:17:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.50,0:17:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 彼瑞兹探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Agent Perez,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.40,0:18:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到你专研已久的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}and welcome to the world that you have long studied.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.50,0:18:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,听从我的忠告 彼瑞兹探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heed my warning, Agent Perez.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.70,0:18:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的下一步行动很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your next move is critical.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.00,0:18:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开门 - 那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Open the door. - What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.10,0:18:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我扶你 我扶你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.50,0:18:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对彼瑞兹探员发生的事深表遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm truly sorry about Agent Perez.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.70,0:18:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说了你的名字 你知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said your name, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.80,0:18:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的遗言是「霍夫曼探员」\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last thing she said was "Detective Hoffman."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.70,0:18:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为什么会那么说 她为什么会提到你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd she say that? Why'd she say your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.20,0:18:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 不知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know. - No?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.20,0:18:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么逃出那建筑物的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you walk out of that building?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.80,0:18:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.40,0:19:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的我在我自己的喉咙上开了个洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}On a gurney with a fucking hole in my throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.50,0:19:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.00,0:19:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有几处瘀伤 和一个你挣脱了绳索的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple of scratches and a story about how your arm straps broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.20,0:19:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,竖锯是不会犯错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jigsaw doesn't make mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.10,0:19:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的又一个推论吗？因为竖锯死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this you theorizing again? Because Jigsaw's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.90,0:19:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是在说他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not talking about him,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.85,0:19:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在说你的整个欺诈部门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about you and your whole crooked department.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.00,0:19:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的部门已经没有了 他们都死了 一个人也不剩\N{\fnArial\fs30}My department's gone. They're all dead. There's no one left.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.20,0:19:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.70,0:19:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从一开始就在追捕竖锯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been chasing Jigsaw from the beginning…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.80,0:19:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,而最后我做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.90,0:19:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以除非你还有什么重要的话要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So unless you've got something else to say…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.70,0:19:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的别来烦我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…back the fuck off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.50,0:19:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看报纸吧！我救了那小女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read the papers. I saved that little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.00,0:19:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼瑞兹探员的事情很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about Agent Perez.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.10,0:19:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是应该休息一下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't you be resting?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.10,0:20:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 埃里克森\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine, Erickson.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.10,0:20:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的 彼得 所以我才让你休病假了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not, Peter. That's why I put you on medical leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.90,0:20:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来应该死于那陷阱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was supposed to die in that trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.80,0:20:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该独自一人去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never should have been there without backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.50,0:20:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要和吉尔·塔克再谈一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna talk to Jill Tuck one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.50,0:20:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经不再负责这个案件了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're no longer handling the case, Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.80,0:20:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.30,0:20:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,读一下吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.80,0:20:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,在现场发现了超过十二具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over a dozen dead bodies were recovered at the scene,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.55,0:20:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括两名警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}two of which were cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.50,0:20:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,竖锯死了 我一共救了多少生命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jigsaw's dead, how many lives did I inevitably save?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.30,0:20:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过置自己与他人于危险中\N{\fnArial\fs30}By endangering yourself and others.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.60,0:20:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不再负责这个案件了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're off the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.90,0:20:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}On whose orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.90,0:20:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.80,0:20:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 彼得 已经结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Peter. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.50,0:22:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.20,0:22:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.80,0:22:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么 - 嘿 不要动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is this? - Hey, don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.40,0:22:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.50,0:22:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么也没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.90,0:22:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是竖锯 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's Jigsaw. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.80,0:22:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道这会发生在我身上的 这就是他的作风\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew this was gonna happen to me. This is what he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.30,0:22:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是竖锯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not Jigsaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.00,0:22:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.60,0:22:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最近没看新闻吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't you watched TV lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.50,0:22:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 好吧！不管是谁做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, whoever it is…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.90,0:22:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正被观察着\N{\fnArial\fs30}…they're watching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.70,0:23:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,以确保我们遵守规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make sure we follow the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.70,0:23:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么跟什么啊 - 如果我是你的话 我就不会那样做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which are what? - I wouldn't do that if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.30,0:23:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你想让自己的头像蒲公英一样开花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you want your head to pop off like a dandelion.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.90,0:23:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道的 - 因为我是长眼睛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you know that? - Because I have eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.50,0:23:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要有人拉动钢索 我们身上的计时器就会启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}One pull- pin starts the timer for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.80,0:23:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你知道它是怎么运作的 你是不会拉动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't wanna do that unless you know how it works,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.85,0:23:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}now, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.40,0:23:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开始吓到我了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're starting to freak me out, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.10,0:23:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好 欢迎来到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, and welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.50,0:23:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,自出娘胎以来 你们就比其他人有更多的优势\N{\fnArial\fs30}From birth, you've all been given the advantages of few others.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.20,0:23:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而通过一些不道德的抉择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet through poor moral decisions…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.10,0:23:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们利用这些优势 自私地\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you've used these advantages to selfishly further…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.30,0:23:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让自己更受益 而牺牲他人的利益\N{\fnArial\fs30}…only yourselves at the expense of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.00,0:23:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天这种想法将会得到考验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, today this singular way of thinking will be put to the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.00,0:23:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 五人连成一线 都有着相同的目标 存活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, five will become one, with a common goal of survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.10,0:23:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们互相联系着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are all connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.50,0:23:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一条钢索穿过了你们脖子上的装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}A cable runs through your collar devices.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.10,0:23:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果绳索被拉紧的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can be pulled so tight…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.00,0:24:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们将会被身后设置好的剃刀斩首\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that you will be decapitated on the mounted razors.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.80,0:24:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一将项圈拿掉的方法就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way to remove the collar is…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.10,0:24:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,…使用玻璃盒子里的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with the keys from the glass boxes…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.50,0:24:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们放在你们面前的台座上\N{\fnArial\fs30}…on the pedestals before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.20,0:24:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而 你们有一个人移动去取钥匙的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, if one of you moves to retrieve a key…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.60,0:24:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所有人的60秒计时器都会启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the 60- second timer will begin for you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.50,0:24:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对这种情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}In choosing how to react to this situation…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.70,0:24:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的本能会驱使你们做出行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}…your lifelong instincts will tell you to do one thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.00,0:24:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我恳求你们做出相反的行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I implore you to do the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.30,0:24:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,让游戏开始吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the games begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.80,0:24:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,总会有人死掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody has to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.00,0:24:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 他说 「不要相信你的本能」\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, it says, "Don't listen to your instincts."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.80,0:24:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 意思就是 不要去拿钥匙 - 你他妈的是傻B吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That means don't go for the keys. - You fucking nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.30,0:24:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不去取钥匙 我们要怎么存活\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we supposed to live if we don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.50,0:24:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在测试我们的忍耐力 - 我们得行动了 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's testing our endurance. - We gotta move, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.00,0:24:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,计时器是连着那些罐子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That timer's connected to those jars.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.20,0:24:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没提到那些罐子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't say anything about those jars.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.20,0:24:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可能没联系的 - 他们是炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They could be nothing. - They're nail bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.50,0:24:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,自制的 很可能是C- 4\N{\fnArial\fs30}Homemade, probably C- 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.70,0:24:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的怎么知道这些的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the fuck do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.40,0:24:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是防火检查员 她见过这些鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a fire inspector. She's seen all kinds of demented shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.70,0:25:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么认识我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.00,0:25:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计 她在问你问题 你怎么认识她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, she's asking you a question. How do you know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.90,0:25:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么认识她的 回答我\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know her? Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.30,0:25:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们都冷静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, let's just keep our cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.70,0:25:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧！我们会想到办法的 - 我们在这里是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, we can figure this out. - We're all here for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.60,0:25:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！根据信息 我们都是有联系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, and we're all connected, as the message said.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.80,0:25:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just need to…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.70,0:25:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是从事什么的 - 你先说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did you do? - You go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.90,0:25:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说我们一出生就占有优势\N{\fnArial\fs30}It said that we were all born with advantages.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.60,0:25:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧！？也就是说我们都来自富有人家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right? That means we're all from money.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.60,0:25:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不是 - 我也不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not. - And neither am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.40,0:25:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 他妈的说得好 南茜·朱尔（小说中的少女侦探）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, nice fucking try, Nancy Drew.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.30,0:25:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那到底是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, what does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.30,0:25:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们利用与生俱来的优势做了些坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did something wrong with an advantage from birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.10,0:25:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不一定就是指钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't have to mean money.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.85,0:25:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么没告诉我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you not telling us? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.00,0:25:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道她的事情 你还知道我们什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know about her, what do you know about the rest of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.30,0:25:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的你能跟我说话吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you fucking talk to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.10,0:26:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 冷静 - 我他妈的很冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Relax. - I am fucking relaxed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.10,0:26:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是游戏 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a game, tweaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.90,0:26:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？你知道我的事越少就越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it? The less you know about me, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.30,0:26:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的在这里逞英雄的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reason why you fucked up your charmed existence…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.40,0:26:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都很清楚 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is pretty obvious to everyone, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.50,0:26:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈的 去你妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you. Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.50,0:26:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都玩过火 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been playing with matches again, have we?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.40,0:26:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都他妈的去死 去你妈的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck all of you and your fucking plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.90,0:28:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你们想被炸得粉身碎骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you wanna be shredded when those bombs go off…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.00,0:28:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议我们还是行动吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I suggest we move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.70,0:28:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.40,0:28:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,做个聪明人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.10,0:28:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是特勤探员斯莱姆的办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Special Agent Strahm's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.50,0:28:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是霍夫曼探员 斯莱姆探员现在方便吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Detective Hoffman. Is Agent Strahm available?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.40,0:28:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不方便 但我可以给你联系特勤探员埃里克森\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not, but I can connect you to Special Agent Erickson.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.20,0:28:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他处理所有的询问\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's handling all inquiries.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.90,0:29:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.40,0:29:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你接通了埃里克森探员的留言信箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've reached the voice mail box of Agent Erickson.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.00,0:29:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,请留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please leave a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.30,0:29:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是霍夫曼探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, this is Detective Hoffman.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.00,0:29:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要和斯莱姆探员讨论一些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed to discuss something with Agent Strahm…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.60,0:29:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我找不到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I can't seem to track him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.70,0:29:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能给我回个电话吗？我会很感激的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you give me a call? It would be greatly appreciated.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.40,0:30:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.10,0:31:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你妹妹啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.60,0:31:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.80,0:31:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 科万 把这拿去分析 - 马上去 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cowan, take this to analysis. - Right away, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.00,0:31:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.40,0:31:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是回办公室拿点东西 我接受你的建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just grabbing some stuff from the office. I'm taking your advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.80,0:31:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,让自己休假？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking some time off, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.60,0:32:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我需要时间康复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I have to heal up, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.60,0:32:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm- hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.90,0:32:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！保持联系 先再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I'll keep in touch. I'll see you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.30,0:33:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍夫曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hoffman.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.90,0:33:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发现了另一具尸体 看起来像是竖锯的实验品\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got another body. Looks like another Jigsaw victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.80,0:33:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要查一下吗？- 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You up for this? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.10,0:33:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,典型的谋杀犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Typical bio. Murder convict.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.80,0:33:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐了5年牢 上个月才被释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Served five years, just released last month.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.90,0:33:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.70,0:33:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫赛斯·巴克斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name's Seth Baxter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.50,0:34:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妹妹的前男友\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister's ex- boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.20,0:34:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是杀了你妹妹的人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the guy that murdered your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.90,0:34:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被判了25年\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was sentenced to 25 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.45,0:34:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,钻法律空子 减到了5年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it reduced to five on a technicality.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.50,0:34:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我只能说 正义得到伸张了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then I'd say justice was served.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.80,0:34:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了他 让这看起来像是竖锯布下的陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed him. Made it look like a Jigsaw trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.40,0:34:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我逮到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.20,0:34:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还不行 - 别关门 会启动计时器的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not yet. - Don't close the door. It'll set off the timer.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.90,0:34:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定吗？- 常理来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you know that for sure? - Educated guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.60,0:34:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要做的是 了解各自的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we need to do is figure out who everyone is.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.00,0:34:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, we know…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.75,0:34:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,…刚才死去的女人是消防部的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that the dead woman worked for the fire department.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.70,0:34:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再是了 她一个月前被解雇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore. She got canned a month ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.30,0:34:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的… 你他妈的怎么会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the fuck do you… How the fuck do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.90,0:34:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要对这负责任 他妈的她的头被砍掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're responsible for this? She had her fucking head cut off!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.00,0:34:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要关门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm closing the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.30,0:35:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要关上这他妈的门 - 安静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna close the fucking door! - Just be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.30,0:35:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.10,0:35:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的故事又是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your story?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.40,0:35:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是城市规划局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I work for the Department of City Planning.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.60,0:35:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 结婚了吗？有孩子吗？- 没有结婚 没有孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Married? Kids? - No, and no.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.20,0:35:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 轮到你了 - 你不打算告诉他们你父亲的事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your turn. - You're not gonna tell them about Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.80,0:35:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我父亲是理查德·吉布斯 - 美洲狮集团的老总？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My dad is Richard Gibbs. - The owner of the Cougars?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.30,0:35:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年来 他一直想建个体育场\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been trying to build a new stadium for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.45,0:35:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不知道的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little did he know…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.70,0:35:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只需要等他女儿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…all he had to do is wait for his daughter…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.40,0:35:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,…在城市规划局找到工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to get a job in City Planning.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.40,0:35:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 你的故事是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you. What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.10,0:35:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又干了些什么狗屎肮脏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What sort of shady shit have you been up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.50,0:35:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一个房地产发展公司的副总裁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a senior V.P. For a real estate development company.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.60,0:35:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么说你也很无聊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're boring too. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.70,0:35:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,马诗福德集团 在这个城市 不通过城市规划局\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Marshvard Group. Yeah, you can't get a permit in this town…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.60,0:35:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是拿不到许可的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…without going through the Department of City Planning.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.90,0:36:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对吗？- 对 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right? - No, you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.70,0:36:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.50,0:36:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.20,0:36:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.10,0:36:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有我知道的孩子 没有工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}No kids that I know of. No job.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.00,0:36:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,信托基金养大的 有人觉得惊讶吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust-fund baby. Anyone surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.00,0:36:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我他妈的受够你的自以为是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so fucking sick of your self- righteousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.50,0:36:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.90,0:36:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是先锋报上的调查记者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an investigative journalist for The Herald.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.90,0:36:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,先锋报？那就是你的成就？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Herald? That's your accomplishment?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.60,0:36:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给一家八卦小报社工作？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You work for a gossip rag?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.50,0:36:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的咬你自己的舌头吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bite your fucking tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.50,0:36:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些罐里的是什么鬼东西啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are in those jars?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.10,0:36:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在炸弹爆炸前 我们快点解决这事吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do this fucking thing before the bombs go off.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.30,0:36:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.50,0:36:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好 欢迎来到下一堂课\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, and welcome to the next lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.60,0:36:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,墙里面有四个洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}These walls hold four chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.60,0:36:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些洞是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These chambers are for safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.50,0:36:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而 必须有钥匙才能进入\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, to access them, a key is needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.50,0:36:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但只有三枚钥匙是能开锁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But only three of the keys will fit the locks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.30,0:37:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些钥匙就在挂在屋顶的罐里\N{\fnArial\fs30}These keys are in the glass jars hanging from the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.20,0:37:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,要快点行动了 因为当时间倒数完的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move quickly, though, because when the clock ticks down…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.50,0:37:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,房间角落的炸弹就会被引爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the explosives in the corners of the room will detonate.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.30,0:37:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只有三个安全洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}With only three points of safety,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.70,0:37:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们到底谁会出局呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}which of you will be the odd man out?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.80,0:37:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,做抉择吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.60,0:37:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.60,0:37:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的 是平的 要找个有形状的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck, it's blank. I need a shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.40,0:37:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰那里 你哪里也去不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your hands off that, you're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.40,0:37:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要这样 - 清醒吧！你他妈的婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop it! - Get a clue, you fucking bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.00,0:37:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是适者生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's survival of the fittest.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.30,0:38:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,平的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blank.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.30,0:38:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,平的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blank.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.90,0:38:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.10,0:38:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了 我找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.10,0:38:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.70,0:38:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你下次走运 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better luck next time, rich boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.70,0:38:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,适者生存 吃屎去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survival of the fittest, my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.30,0:38:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.90,0:39:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于赛斯·巴克斯特的案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything all right with Detective Kerr…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.40,0:39:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,克瑞探员都没问题吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in the Seth Baxter case?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.10,0:39:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.30,0:39:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲斯克 随时向我汇报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fisk. You keep me posted.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.40,0:39:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道了 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Will do. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.10,0:39:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛斯的案件后 你就参与每次有关竖锯的调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Seth, you were involved in every investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.20,0:39:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你第一次见竖锯是什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did you first meet Jigsaw?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.80,0:40:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.80,0:41:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.50,0:41:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heel! Heel, I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.20,0:41:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别刺激他 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't provoke him. Asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.20,0:41:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊 拜托 皮威 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ. Come on, Peewee. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.50,0:41:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 皮威 - 皮威\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Peewee. - Peewee.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.00,0:41:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.50,0:41:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你介意吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.90,0:41:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上去？- 是的 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Going up? - Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.20,0:41:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪层\N{\fnArial\fs30}What floor are you going to?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.70,0:42:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们的目的地是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're both going to the same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.00,0:42:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你为什么会在这里 对吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why you're here, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.60,0:42:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说 模仿是最诚挚的奉承\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say imitation is the sincerest form of flattery.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.00,0:42:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不知怎的 我觉得因别人的艺术\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I find it somewhat distasteful…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.50,0:43:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,而自己得到功劳 心里很不爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to be given credit for work that's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.20,0:43:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是那些稍逊一筹的艺术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially inferior work.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.20,0:43:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你一样 我知道失去家人是什么滋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you, I know what it's like to lose family.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.20,0:43:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道保护不了心爱的人的滋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what it's like not to be able to protect loved ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.50,0:43:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是种很无助的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a powerless feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.30,0:43:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.70,0:43:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,微力扳机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hair trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.90,0:43:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.20,0:43:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.50,0:43:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇可以改变一个人 让你成为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vengeance can change a person. Make you into something…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.70,0:43:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远也想不到的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you never thought you were capable of being.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.30,0:44:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不像你 我从没杀过任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But unlike you, I've never killed anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.80,0:44:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会给他们机会 - 你把这叫机会吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I give people a chance. - You call this a chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.30,0:44:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们看着吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.40,0:44:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的游戏才刚开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our game's just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.95,0:44:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的游戏？你根本不认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our game? You don't even know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.60,0:44:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识你 在你追捕我的时候 我也在跟踪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you. I followed you as you've pursued me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.50,0:44:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识你 我也知道你妹妹的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you. I know about your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.80,0:44:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你有多关心她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how you cared for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.70,0:44:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道她是你唯一的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know she was your only family.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.90,0:44:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.20,0:44:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.30,0:44:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你坐在酒吧！里直到它打烊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sit in bars until closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.35,0:44:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喝酒 这样你才能入睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You drink so you can sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.50,0:44:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你醉乎乎地走向你的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stagger to your car…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.20,0:44:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一天又重复同样的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and then you start it all over again the next day.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.70,0:45:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着我发现了你做什么来消遣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I discovered what you do for recreation.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.50,0:45:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.60,0:45:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以抛弃正义\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can dispense justice…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.50,0:45:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,同一时候 又给予他们一个机会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and give people a chance to value their lives…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.55,0:45:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,…来衡量他们的性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in the same moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.30,0:45:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺带一提\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by the way…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.90,0:45:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那钟摆上的刀锋是劣质品\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the blade on your pendulum was inferior.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.90,0:45:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要它真正锋利的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want a true edge…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.80,0:45:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得要用经过锻造的钢\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you have to used tempered steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.20,0:45:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样才能持久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tempering's better for the long haul.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.40,0:45:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也为了个持久的目标吧！探员？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You in this for the long haul, detective?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.00,0:45:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经当了20年警察 对你来说足够长了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I been a cop for 20 years. Is that long enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.40,0:45:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你和我都应该知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you and I both know…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.40,0:45:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,…这城市里重复犯罪的人的数目\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the statistics for repeat offenders in this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.60,0:45:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,67.5%的罪犯在三年内会再次进入监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}67.5 percent of criminals are back in prison within three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.90,0:45:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想我怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.00,0:45:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也许觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you might look at…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.80,0:45:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对赛斯所做的事是为民除害\N{\fnArial\fs30}…what you did to Seth as a kind of public service.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.30,0:46:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我唯一的家人 他不该得到任何机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was my only family. He didn't deserve a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.60,0:46:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是禽兽 - 每个人都应该得到一次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He was an animal. - Everybody deserves a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.40,0:46:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没看到那血泊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't see the blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.50,0:46:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没看到他妈的他对她做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't see what he fucking did to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.90,0:46:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀人对我来说是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing is distasteful…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.80,0:46:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不合口味的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.50,0:46:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一种更好 更有效率的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a better, more efficient way.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.60,0:46:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了什么 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you see? Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.70,0:46:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看到了什么 - 告诉我你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you see? - Tell me what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.80,0:46:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要知道 你是否有生存下去的勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna know if you have what it takes to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.80,0:47:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.30,0:47:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白吗？这就是我所说的不同方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, it's a different method that I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.50,0:47:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果测试对象从我的游戏中生存下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If a subject survives my method…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.00,0:47:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们将会得到重生\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he or she is instantly rehabilitated.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.50,0:47:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！你要一次机会吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you want a chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.00,0:47:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要一次机会吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.90,0:47:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会给你一次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.50,0:47:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你称之为竖锯的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the man you call Jigsaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.20,0:47:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,逮捕我是你的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your duty to bring me in…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.60,0:47:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I know who you are…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.50,0:47:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I know what you鈥檝e done.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.90,0:47:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么说这是勒索\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is blackmail.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.50,0:47:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.00,0:47:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是赎罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is redemption.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.30,0:48:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是给你一个选择 仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just giving you an option, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.10,0:48:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你可以逮捕我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you can arrest me…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.70,0:48:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这么做的话 你的人生就结束了 你是知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but doing so, your life ends as you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.00,0:48:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.50,0:48:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以去探索\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you could explore…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.20,0:48:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种让罪犯重生的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a method of rehabilitation…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.70,0:48:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,使你夜晚能安睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that'll permit you to sleep at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.80,0:48:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我可以现在就杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I could kill you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.60,0:48:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不是一个真正的杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not a true killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.00,0:48:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的困境\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your dilemma…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.40,0:48:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我对你所了解的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the information that I have on you…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.15,0:48:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,正位于一个很适合的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is exactly where it needs to be…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.10,0:48:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,随着我的消失 那信息将会被公布\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and it will be released in the event of my disappearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.90,0:49:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,与其信你 他们会更信任我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll never believe your word over mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.00,0:49:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意冒这个险吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You willing to take that risk?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.30,0:49:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁灭你一生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Risk of ruining your own life…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.60,0:49:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了保护一个释放杀人犯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in order to protect a corrupt legal system…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.20,0:49:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,腐败的法律系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that puts murderers back on the streets?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.50,0:49:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妹妹会怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would your sister feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.70,0:49:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你正站在交叉路上 探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're at a crossroads, detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.50,0:49:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,做抉择吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.70,0:49:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮助竖锯把那些受害者抓了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you help Jigsaw get all of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.20,0:50:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍夫曼探员 这位是特勤探员埃里克森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detective Hoffman, this is Special Agent Erickson.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.10,0:50:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于竖锯的案件 你有什么要讨论的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had something you needed to discuss about the Jigsaw case?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.90,0:50:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我今晚去了斯莱姆探员的病房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I stopped by Agent Strahm's room tonight at the hospital,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.10,0:50:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他不在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he wasn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.40,0:50:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 希望他没事吧！- 噢 是的 他很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I hope he's all right. - Oh, yeah, he's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.80,0:50:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯莱姆在推断除了阿曼达·杨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Strahm was theorizing about the possibility…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.40,0:51:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,竖锯还有另一个同谋的可能性\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of an additional accomplice to Jigsaw, other than Amanda Young.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.50,0:51:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,某个我们目前还不知道的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone who might be currently unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.60,0:51:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有向你提过类似的事情吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he ever mention anything like that to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.50,0:51:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 而且 我是刚加入这个案件的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but then again, I'm new to the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.80,0:51:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 也许你可以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, maybe you could…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.65,0:51:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,…让他尽快联系我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…get him to contact me at his earliest convenience.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.70,0:51:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了 还有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will do. And…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.20,0:51:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,依你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in your theorizing…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.50,0:51:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得谁会是同谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who exactly did you suspect would be an accomplice?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.80,0:51:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怀疑是内部的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he suspected someone on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.50,0:51:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个有权限的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone with access.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.80,0:51:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有趣的推理\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an interesting theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.30,0:51:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,探员 我们明早见个面吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detective, what do you say we reconnect in the morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.00,0:51:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.00,0:52:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,死路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.50,0:52:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人是混蛋 但他很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy was an asshole, but he was smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.50,0:52:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对我们还有用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could've used him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.10,0:52:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但总要有人死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, someone had to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.60,0:52:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要做那个牺牲者吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you rather it'd been you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.70,0:53:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是怎么抓住你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd they get you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.50,0:54:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.50,0:54:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了你 我要杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill you! I'm gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.00,0:54:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.00,0:55:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 保罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Paul.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.20,0:55:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自残 是因为你真的在寻死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you cut yourself because you truly wanted to die…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.50,0:55:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是因为你想得到关注\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or did you just want some attention?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.40,0:55:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 你将会告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, you'll show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.20,0:55:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要活下去的话 你得再次自残\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to live, you'll have to cut yourself again.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.80,0:55:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意流掉多少血来保命呢 保罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much blood will you shed to stay alive, Paul?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.30,0:56:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想过会感到自责\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't expect to feel any remorse.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.90,0:56:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,要冷静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The heart cannot be involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.00,0:56:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,感情用事的话 就什么也办不到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emotionally, there can be nothing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.30,0:57:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不要投入私人感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can never be personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.40,0:57:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们走吧！- 不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.00,0:57:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的事情还没完\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not done yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.20,0:57:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚你会看到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight you will see…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.75,0:57:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,…杀戮与救赎的区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the difference between killing and rehabilitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.60,0:57:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个你需要注意的探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is another detective that you should be aware of.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.50,0:57:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫泰普\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name's Tapp.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.30,0:57:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很聪明 而且快接近真相了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's smart, and he's getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.90,0:57:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.90,0:57:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你帮我把他引向某个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to lead him to someone for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.50,0:57:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}A doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.70,0:57:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个需要被医治的医人者\N{\fnArial\fs30}A healer who needs some healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.50,0:57:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的吗？医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this yours, doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.40,0:58:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你提供了这些警局里的档案 对吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You supplied these police files, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.70,0:58:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得事情会照你所想发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're assuming this is gonna play out the way you want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.20,0:58:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没设想任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.90,0:58:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是猜测可能性 我让游戏自行开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}I anticipate the possibilities, and I let the game play out.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.20,0:58:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么需要阿曼达参与这游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why do you need Amanda in the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.70,0:59:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保游戏规则被遵守\N{\fnArial\fs30}To ensure that the rules are followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.20,0:59:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不会替任何人做决定 她只会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}She won't make decisions for anyone. She'll just…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.50,0:59:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,提供选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}…offer choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.60,0:59:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠左边一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little to your left.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.60,0:59:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那很多事情都要看偶然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That leaves a lot to chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.90,0:59:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你擅长猜测人的思维\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're good at anticipating the human mind…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.40,0:59:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,偶然就会变成必然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it leaves nothing to chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.30,1:00:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.70,1:00:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.00,1:00:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 又有炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. More bombs.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.30,1:00:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！你做了什么事 才会被抓到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. What'd you do to get here?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.30,1:00:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我做了些事 一群人遇害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}L… I did something, and a bunch of people were killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.10,1:00:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是无意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean to.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.60,1:00:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们确实是死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're still dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.30,1:00:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这就是你在这里的原因？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's why you're here? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.40,1:00:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,做了这种事 你不应该要坐牢吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't you have gone to jail for something like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.50,1:01:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody else knows.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.10,1:01:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来某人知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody does.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.50,1:01:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没杀任何人 如果这是你的问题的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't kill anybody, if that's what you're asking.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.10,1:01:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有想过这么问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.00,1:01:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我通过了某个建楼的提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I grant building permits.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.00,1:01:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 也许有些人比其他人更值得拥有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yeah, some people might have been more deserving than others…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.30,1:01:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道吗？这是做生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but you know what? That's the business.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.60,1:01:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果有人跟你说不同的想法 他们只是愚蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if someone tells you different, then they're just stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.50,1:01:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者天真 或者两者都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or naive. Or both.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.20,1:01:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,屁话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.50,1:01:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你接受贿赂 你是他妈的骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take bribes. You're a fucking liar.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.50,1:01:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你欺骗大众 那样很不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cheat people. That's not nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.70,1:01:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.40,1:01:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想她也算不上圣母吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure she's not exactly Mother Teresa either.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.00,1:01:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.50,1:01:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在人口最密集的城市…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I build condos in one of the most densely…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.30,1:01:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,…建了个公寓\N{\fnArial\fs30}…populated cities in the country.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.30,1:01:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你总不能不拆掉旧楼就建新楼吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't put up a new building without tearing down a few old ones.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.00,1:02:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们这类狗屎来到这里都是应得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're all bags of shit that deserve to be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.85,1:02:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good. That's great.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.80,1:02:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking great.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.00,1:02:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得就是这原因？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So is that what you think this is?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.60,1:02:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得还有其他联系吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think there's any other connection?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.80,1:02:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我觉得有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.80,1:02:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是这么觉得 但我不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do. And I don't give a shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.30,1:02:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,关上那他妈的门 我们来听规则吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close the fucking door. We have to hear the rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.50,1:02:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好 欢迎来到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, and welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.10,1:02:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一定很渴望…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must all be eager…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.90,1:02:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,…上下一堂改变自身的课了吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to learn the next important lesson in your transformation.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.90,1:02:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个游戏是为了架起桥梁\N{\fnArial\fs30}The game before you is designed…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.25,1:02:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,修补你们之间的分歧\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to bridge the gap between you all.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.80,1:02:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,要打开这房间门上的五把锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}In order to open the five locks on the door out of this room…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.60,1:02:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须得关掉连通着的五个电路\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the five electrical circuits powering them must be closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.60,1:02:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的办法就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way to do this is…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.95,1:02:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,让五根电线都接上浴缸里的水\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to find a way to connect all five cords to the bath water.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.50,1:02:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,电路被关上后 门就会打开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close the circuits and the door will open.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.80,1:03:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们要快点行动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you must work quickly…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.30,1:03:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为三分钟后\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for in three minutes,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.05,1:03:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一股电流将会通过这房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}an electrical current will surge through this room…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.00,1:03:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时候门会被永远锁上\N{\fnArial\fs30}…locking the door forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.90,1:03:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁要做那桥梁呢 做抉择吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who will bridge the gap? The choice is yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.30,1:03:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.70,1:03:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不够长 他妈的我们要怎么做啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not gonna reach. How the fuck are we gonna do this?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.40,1:03:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想办法吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.90,1:03:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要进浴缸去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna get in the tub…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.60,1:03:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要把五根电线接在你身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and we're gonna connect the five cords to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.20,1:03:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你同时也会要了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're gonna kill me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.80,1:03:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 进去 - 是啊 我看起来更像是会洗澡的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get in. - Yeah, I'm more of a shower guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.50,1:03:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我现在不想这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I'm gonna do that right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.60,1:03:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的进浴缸去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the fucking tub.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.80,1:03:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈的 你这贱货 他妈的你进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you, you bitch. You get in the fucking tub.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.90,1:03:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.50,1:03:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.90,1:04:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了她 你他妈的杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed her. You fucking killed her.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.20,1:04:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不信任她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't trust her.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.20,1:04:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊 你们俩有什么恩怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ. What is it with you two?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.00,1:04:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上嘴 帮我移动尸体吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just shut up and help me with the body.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.70,1:04:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 不要 不要让你的身体接触她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey. No. Don't let your body touch hers.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.30,1:05:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天啊 是个钩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, it's a hook.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.80,1:05:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这插进她头里 要不我们就出不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stick it in her head or we don't get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.40,1:05:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.60,1:05:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.70,1:05:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 是吉尔·塔克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir. It's Jill Tuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.60,1:05:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.50,1:05:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是特勤探员埃里克森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Special Agent Erickson.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.80,1:05:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你这么晚还来见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for seeing me so late in the day.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.90,1:05:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.30,1:05:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没你的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll be all.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.30,1:05:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.20,1:05:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们有什么能帮到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you need from us?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.20,1:05:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我被跟踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm being followed.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.70,1:06:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那更应该去找警察啊 塔克小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that sounds more like police work, Miss Tuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.70,1:06:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他们帮不到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think they can help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.00,1:06:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为？- 因为是你们FBI的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Because? - Because it's you. The FBI.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.80,1:06:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.50,1:06:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,从约翰开始被确认为竖锯杀人犯时就开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It started when John was first identified as the Jigsaw killer.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.00,1:06:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时候我不感到惊讶 但现在我还是感觉被跟踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't surprise me then, but I'm still being followed.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.80,1:06:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,被谁 塔克小姐 谁会跟踪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}By who, Miss Tuck? Who would be following you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.50,1:06:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是那个审问我的探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's the agent who interrogated me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.60,1:06:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯莱姆探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Strahm.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.60,1:06:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他为什么要跟踪你呢 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And why would he be following you? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.90,1:06:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还把这事跟其他人说了吗？- 只跟你说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who else have you told about this? - Only you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.70,1:07:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on with Amanda?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.90,1:07:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是告诉我 要启蒙他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you tell me the only way to truly offer enlightenment…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.00,1:07:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,切忌感情用事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is by detaching emotionally?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.40,1:07:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你可以拥有阿曼达所没有的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can have something Amanda doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.70,1:07:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,匿名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anonymity.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.90,1:07:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是最好的保护 那是我所赋予你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the greatest protection. That's what I've given you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.20,1:07:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你去设置个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to set up a game…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.80,1:07:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许那游戏 你现在还不很了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that may not be entirely clear to you right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.70,1:07:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我向你保证 那些被测试的对象\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I assure you that the people being tested…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.40,1:07:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,比你想像中更重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}…are part of something much larger.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.70,1:07:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是互相联系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're connected.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.60,1:07:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,到最后 所有碎片会联系起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So in the end, all the pieces will fit together…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.50,1:07:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切会变得明朗\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and it'll be clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.00,1:07:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.70,1:08:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿曼达会让你失望的 - 等着瞧吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amanda will fail you. - We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.90,1:08:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.80,1:08:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么 - 是时候开始游戏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's this? - It's time to play a game.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.30,1:08:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.80,1:08:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我 这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me. What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.90,1:08:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this? Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.00,1:08:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么把我困在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you keeping me here?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.70,1:08:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是什么地方 这里是什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this place? What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.00,1:09:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本来都应该死掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were all supposed to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.60,1:09:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是他妈的在测试你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just fucking testing you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.50,1:09:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我女儿在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.50,1:09:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.90,1:09:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没活过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.00,1:09:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都没活过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody made it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.20,1:09:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你就充当英雄的角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were supposed to be the hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.90,1:10:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得 你到底在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter, where the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.60,1:10:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.10,1:10:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你接通了特勤探员彼得 斯莱姆的留言信箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've reached the voice mail for Special Agent Peter Strahm.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.30,1:10:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,请留言吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave a message.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.90,1:10:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,科万 我要定位斯莱姆的移动电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cowan, I wanna put a locator on Strahm's mobile phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.30,1:10:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上办 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right away, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.10,1:10:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽快回复我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.80,1:10:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.80,1:11:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这他妈的是什么 - 是我们的下一场恶梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell is that? - It's our next nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.30,1:11:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有刀锋\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are blades in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.00,1:11:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是与门连着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's connected to the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.20,1:12:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧杯被填满后 门就会开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the beaker fills up, the door opens.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.30,1:12:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,用什么填满\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fills with what?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.20,1:12:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,用血 我们的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood. Our blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.70,1:12:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们要把手伸进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think an arm is supposed to go in there…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.20,1:12:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后用我们的血填满烧杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to fill the beaker.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.20,1:12:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 为什么我们不能用隔壁房的水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Why can't we just use the water from the other room?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.40,1:12:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 狭缝是闭上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the slots are closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.70,1:12:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要伸手进去才能打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to stick our arm in to keep them open,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.25,1:12:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但伸进去就拉不出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they'd get stuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.00,1:12:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得关上那门\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to close that door.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.40,1:12:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.50,1:12:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拼了性命来到这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fight to the death,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.10,1:12:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后牺牲一个人的鲜血 而另一个人则得到自由？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and one gets to freedom with the other person's blood?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.20,1:12:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.60,1:12:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还拿着第一个房间的钥匙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you still have the keys from that first room?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.90,1:12:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有 - 试一下那边的门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Try one of them on that door.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.40,1:12:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不会有用的 - 也许会呢 这个有钥匙洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It won't work. - No, it might. This one has a keyhole.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.40,1:12:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这…这甚至不是同一把锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It… It's not even the same lock.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.20,1:13:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这机器有五个狭缝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, why are there five slots in this machine?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.00,1:13:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不应该只有一个吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't there only be one?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.00,1:13:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们本来都有用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all would have worked.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.70,1:13:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到你了 斯莱姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are, Strahm.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.30,1:13:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！我找到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.90,1:13:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这不是好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think this is a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.30,1:13:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那浴缸不是留给一个人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tub wasn't meant for one person.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.60,1:13:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本应该每人拿着一根电线\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were supposed to hold one cable each…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.60,1:14:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样就只会被小电击一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and suffer a small shock.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.40,1:14:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是为五个人设置好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was meant for five people.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.00,1:14:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的游戏都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all were. Every game.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.40,1:14:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在第一个房间 我们只需要一把钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only needed one key in the first room.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.10,1:14:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都可以用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all worked,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.90,1:14:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何一把钥匙都能打开所有项圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}and any one of them would have opened every collar.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.20,1:14:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,在第二个房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the second room,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.15,1:14:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个洞都不是只能容纳一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the three tubes were large enough for more than one person.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.30,1:14:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本应该合作 那样我们都能够存活\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were supposed to work together so we all survived.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.50,1:14:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是游戏的玩法\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the game.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.30,1:14:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的本能会驱使你们做出行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your instincts will tell you to do one thing…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.70,1:14:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我恳求你们做出相反的行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I implore you to do the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.90,1:14:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.60,1:14:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 他妈的太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Big fucking whoops.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.80,1:14:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好 欢迎来到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, and welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.60,1:14:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个旅程是为了让你们去探索\N{\fnArial\fs30}This journey has been one of discovery…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.60,1:14:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你们已经发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and hopefully you've discovered…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.75,1:14:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,整体比部分更重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that the whole is greater than the sum of its parts.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.70,1:14:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,举个例子说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The human body, for instance,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.70,1:14:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,人体是自然界最耐用的杰作\N{\fnArial\fs30}is an astoundingly durable creation.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.80,1:15:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,它含有大约10品脱的血液\N{\fnArial\fs30}It contains approximately 10 pints of blood…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.70,1:15:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而 哪怕只剩下一半 人体还是能正常运作\N{\fnArial\fs30}…yet it is still able to operate with just half of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.90,1:15:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们面前的装置代表着牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}The device before you is one of sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.80,1:15:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,血液的牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sacrifice of blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.50,1:15:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,要想打开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}In order to open the door,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.75,1:15:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧杯必须被填满到标注的刻度\N{\fnArial\fs30}the beaker must be filled to the marked level…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.10,1:15:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个刻度并不是巧合\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a level that is of no coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.70,1:15:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于用谁的鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}This amount can come from any one of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.10,1:15:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不重要 时间才是最重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That does not matter. What does matter is time.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.80,1:15:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,15分钟后 如果烧杯没被填入鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}For in 15 minutes, if the beaker is not filled…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.70,1:15:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸弹将会被引爆 大门就会永远被封死\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the bombs will explode and the doors will be sealed forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.10,1:15:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以现在我问你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now I ask you,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.55,1:15:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了生存 你们愿意牺牲多少鲜血呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}how much blood will you give in order to survive?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.10,1:15:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的 他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck! Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.30,1:15:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！那么可以让一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so one person can fill the beaker…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.95,1:15:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,用10品脱的血填满烧杯 然后死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with ten pints of blood and die.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.80,1:15:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者两个人同时填\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or two people can fill it…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.00,1:15:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只用5品脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with five pints…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.20,1:15:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许能活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and maybe live.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.70,1:15:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.10,1:16:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lied.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.90,1:16:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识那个调查记者 他叫查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the investigative journalist in there. His name is Charles.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.10,1:16:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在写一篇关于我所做的事的文章\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was writing a story about what I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.00,1:16:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.60,1:16:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个商人给了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dealer gave me…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.00,1:16:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一盎司海洛因 只要我烧掉一栋废弃的楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}…an ounce of heroin to burn down an abandoned building.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.50,1:16:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it wa…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.70,1:16:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天啊 那并不是废弃的楼 有八个人在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. It wasn't abandoned. There was eight people in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.00,1:16:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,八个人死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight people died.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.70,1:17:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦政府插手调查了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the feds got involved.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.30,1:17:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被逮住后 我老爸花钱让我脱身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I got caught but I made a deal and my dad got me off.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.20,1:17:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个和我做交易的人消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy who hired me disappeared and nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.85,1:17:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后什么事都没有发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.40,1:17:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以她才认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how she knew me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.50,1:17:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个死在浴缸的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The woman in the tub.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.40,1:17:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是火把我们联系起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fire. It's what connects us.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.60,1:17:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那消防调查员写了事故的假报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fire inspector who wrote the bogus accident report…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.90,1:17:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那城市规划局的女人受贿\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the city planner…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.90,1:17:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,批了建新楼的提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who pushed through the residential permits…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.20,1:17:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个记者隐瞒了真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the journalist that buried the investigative story…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.00,1:17:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸毒的富家小子放了火\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the rich- kid junkie who was the patsy…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.10,1:18:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,房地产的发展商让一切计划实施起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the real estate developer who set it all in motion.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.70,1:18:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们杀了八个人 然后得到了房产权\N{\fnArial\fs30}We killed eight people and stole the property,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.85,1:18:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没有人在意\N{\fnArial\fs30}and nobody cared.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.80,1:18:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人在意吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody cared?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.40,1:18:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那八个人和他们的家人会在意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight people and their families cared.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.20,1:18:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦政府会 看看我他妈的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}The feds cared. Look at my fucking arm.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.05,1:18:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在意 我在意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cared! I cared!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.60,1:18:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你没有得到公正审判\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you didn't face justice.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.60,1:18:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of us did.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.80,1:18:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did they all do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.20,1:18:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 是因为钱吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Was it for money?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.20,1:18:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的计划？你就是幕后黑手？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was your plan? You were the one behind it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.60,1:18:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那楼有八个人在\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was eight people in that building.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.65,1:18:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须知道的 明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had to know that. Did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.10,1:18:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a monster.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.20,1:18:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So are you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.30,1:18:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来到这里都是应得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both deserve to be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.10,1:19:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个人做不了 看着我 我一个人做不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do this alone. Look at me. I can't do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.00,1:19:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.50,1:20:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们数三声\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go on three.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.20,1:20:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.20,1:20:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.00,1:20:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的手放进洞里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your hand in the hole!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.50,1:20:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.30,1:22:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 斯莱姆探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Agent Strahm.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.20,1:22:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你现在听到这录音\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are hearing this,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.55,1:22:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那说明你再一次找到了你要找的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you have once again found what you're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.10,1:22:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者你是这么认为的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or so you think.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.60,1:22:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的奉献值得嘉许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dedication is to be commended.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.70,1:22:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我问你 你是否在你的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I ask you if you have…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.05,1:22:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,探索旅途中学到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}…learned anything on your journey of discovery.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.50,1:22:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,俗话说\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the old adage goes:
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.60,1:22:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,「被愚弄一次 是你的耻辱」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Fool me once, shame on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.35,1:22:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,「被愚弄两次 则是我的耻辱」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fool me twice, shame on me."
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.50,1:22:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让自己陷入了需要信任的境况\N{\fnArial\fs30}The situation you find yourself in is one of trust.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.90,1:22:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我问你 特勤探员斯莱姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I ask you, Special Agent Strahm,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.10,1:22:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你学会相信我了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}have you learned to trust me?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.50,1:22:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,想在这房里存活下来的唯一办法就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way to survive this room is…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.15,1:23:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,…进入你前面的玻璃盒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}…by entering the glass box before you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.00,1:23:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,疼痛是会有的 但你有机会活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pain will be incurred, but you have a chance of survival.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.00,1:23:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.30,1:23:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.80,1:25:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我逮到你了 你狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you, you motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.30,1:25:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.80,1:25:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said drop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.20,1:26:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁对你干了这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who did this to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.90,1:26:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.40,1:26:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}We worked together.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.20,1:26:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要紧急医疗救治 圣博斯大街1293号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need immediate medical assistance. 1293 Sandburst Drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.10,1:27:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, Peter.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.60,1:27:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我怎样打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me how to open it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.80,1:27:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要怎样打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I open it?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.80,1:27:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而 如果你选择不进去 将不会有人再见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, if you choose not to, you will never be heard from again.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.70,1:27:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的尸体永远不会被发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your body will never be found.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.10,1:27:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会永久消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will simply vanish.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.80,1:27:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问你 特勤探员斯莱姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ask you, Special Agent Strahm,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.70,1:27:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你学会相信我了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}have you learned enough to trust me?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.80,1:27:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会听从我的忠告吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you heed my warning?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.70,1:28:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为如果你不… - 去你妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For if you do not… - Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.80,1:28:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这间房将永远是你的坟墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}…this room will forever be your tomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.40,1:28:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的遗物将会与你永随\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my legacy will become yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.90,1:28:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你擅长猜测人的思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're good at anticipating the human mind…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.70,1:28:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我觉得我被跟踪了 - 谁会跟踪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think I'm being followed. - Who would be following you?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.50,1:28:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要再跟吉尔·塔克再谈一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna talk to Jill Tuck one last time.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.00,1:28:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怀疑某个内部的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He suspected someone on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.60,1:28:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,偶然就会变成必然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It leaves nothing to chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.30,1:28:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本来都应该死掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were all supposed to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.30,1:28:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就充当英雄的角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were supposed to be the hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.70,1:28:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,做抉择吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make your choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.90,1:28:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,科万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cowan.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.60,1:28:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我是埃里克森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, this is Erickson.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.00,1:28:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你发布一则通缉令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to put out an APB.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.90,1:28:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,疑犯名字是彼得 斯莱姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suspect's name is Peter Strahm.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.10,1:28:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.90,1:28:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,特勤探员彼得 斯莱姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Special Agent Peter Strahm.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.40,1:29:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会阻止你的 你狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna stop you, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.18,1:29:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是谁 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who you are. I know.
